&lt;td colspan="3" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 364.6px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 3.8px; text-align: center"&gt;既発行株式数＋新株発行(処分)株式数&lt;/p&gt;
